'''Madagascar''' is the 16th stage in [[Empire of Cats]]. [[Gory]] is introduced here. Upon completion in Chapter 1, [[Fish Cat (Normal Cat)|Fish Cat]] and [[Zombie Cat (Special Cat)|Zombie Cat]] will be available to unlock from the [[Upgrade Menu]].

