==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Those Guys]] spawn, delay 1~10 seconds<sup>30f~300f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Doge]]s spawn, delay 10~20 seconds<sup>300f~600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Those Guys]] spawn, delay 10~20 seconds<sup>300f~600f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 85% HP:
**12 [[Those Guys]] spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 0.67~2 seconds<sup>20f~60f</sup>.
**1 [[Gory]] spawns.
*When the base reaches 60% HP:
**1 [[Gory]] spawns as the boss.

==Strategy==
Start the battle by upgrading your [[Worker Cat]]. When the enemies come near the [[Cat Base]], spam meatshields and [[Axe Cat (Normal Cat)|Axe Cats]]. Keep upgrading your Worker Cat until it reaches max level, then spawn [[Cow Cat (Normal Cat)|Cow Cat]]. After Gory appears, spam [[Gross Cat (Normal Cat)|Gross Cats]] and meatshields.

